   "narrated": "Narrated Ibn `Abbas:",
   "text": "Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"Gabriel read the Qur'an to me in one way (i.e. dialect) and I continued asking him to read it in different ways till he read it in seven different ways.\"",
